  <para style="h">Filipi</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ikete Pawulo yandikiye ab’i Filipi</para>
  <para style="toc2">Filipi</para>
  <para style="toc3">Flp</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ikete Pawulo yandikiye ab’i</para>
  <para style="mt1">Filipi</para>
  <para style="ie" />
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="PHP 1" />
  <para style="po">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 1:1" />Twebwe Pawulo na Timoteyo abakozi ba Kristo Yesu,</para>
  <para style="po" vid="PHP 1:1">Turabandikiye mwese abera bo muri Kristo Yesu muri i Filipi, hamwe n’abarongozi b’Ishengero n’abadiyakoni bose:<verse eid="PHP 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="po">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 1:2" />Ubuntu n’amahoro biva ku Mana Data wa twese no ku Mwami wacu Yesu Kristo bibane namwe.<verse eid="PHP 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Amasengesho Pawulo asengera ab’i Filipi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 1:3" />Nama nshima Imana igihe cose ndabibutse. <verse eid="PHP 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 1:4" />Kandi igihe cose nsenze, nama ndabasengera nuzuye umunezero <verse eid="PHP 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 1:5" />kuko twafatanije gukwiza Ubutumwa Bwiza, uhereye igihe mwabwumva kugeza n’ubu. <verse eid="PHP 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 1:6" />Sinkekeranya ko Imana yatanguje ico gikorwa ciza muri mwebwe izokibandanya gushika ikirangije, ku musi Kristo Yesu azogarukirako.<verse eid="PHP 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 1:7" />Birabereye ko ndabiyumvira gutyo mwese, kuko ndabafise ku mutima. Mwese musangiye nanje ubuntu bw’Imana, haba mu gihe ndi mw’ibohero canke ndiko ndagwanira Ubutumwa Bwiza ndabwemanga. <verse eid="PHP 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 1:8" />Imana ni yo yombera icabona c’ingene ndabakunda n’ingene nipfuza kubabona n’umutima w’inkumbu ziva kuri Kristo Yesu.<verse eid="PHP 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 1:9" />Ico nsengera ni uko urukundo rwanyu rworushiriza kugwira, kandi mugakomeza kwunguka ubwenge n’ugutahura, <verse eid="PHP 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 1:10" />kugira ngo mushobore kumenya neza iciza kurusha ibindi ico ari co, mutanduye kandi mutagira umugayo gushika aho Kristo azogarukira. <verse eid="PHP 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 1:11" />Ndabipfuriza kwama mwuzuye ivyamwa vy’ukugororoka biva kuri Kristo Yesu, kugira ngo biheshe Imana icubahiro n’amashimwe.<verse eid="PHP 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mu buryo bwose Kristo aravugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 1:12" />Bene Data, ndashaka ko mumenya ko ivyanshikiye vyatumye Ubutumwa Bwiza butera buja imbere. <verse eid="PHP 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 1:13" />Kuko umuntu wese hano, mbere n’abacunze ikirimba bose barimwo, barazi neza ko ndi mw’ibohero kubera Kristo. <verse eid="PHP 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 1:14" />Kandi, bivuye ku kubohwa kwanje, bene Data ba hano barashize amanga mu Mwami, bituma bashobora kuvuga ijambo ry’Imana bashize ubwoba.<verse eid="PHP 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 1:15" />Ni ivy’ukuri ko bamwe bavuga ivya Kristo babitewe n’ishari n’umutima w’impari, ariko hariho n’abavuga ivya Kristo bafise intumbero nziza. <verse eid="PHP 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 1:16" />Abo babikora kubera kunkunda, kuko bazi ko mbohewe hano kubera kugwanira Ubutumwa Bwiza. <verse eid="PHP 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 1:17" />Barya bandi bo bigisha Kristo ku bw’inyungu zabo, badasunitswe n’umutima utunganye, kuko bagomba kunteza imibabaro mu gihe ndi mw’ibohero. <verse eid="PHP 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 1:18" />Ariko nta co bitwaye. Babikora mu kuri canke babikora mu buryarya, igihambaye ni uko Kristo ariko aravugwa. Kandi ivyo ndabinezererewe, mbere nzokomeza kubinezerererwa.<verse eid="PHP 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 1:19" />Kuko ndazi ko kubera amasengesho munsengera n’imfashanyo iva kuri Mpwemu wa Kristo Yesu ivyo vyose bizotuma mbohorwa. <verse eid="PHP 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 1:20" />Mfise ivyizigiro vyinshi ko ntazokwigera maramara, ariko ko nzokomeza gushira ubwoba, nk’uko namye. Kandi ndizera ko ubu n’ibihe vyose Kristo azokwama ahabwa icubahiro mu mubiri wanje, haba mu kubaho kwanje canke mu rupfu rwanje. <verse eid="PHP 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 1:21" />Kuko kuri jewe, kubaho ni ku bwa Kristo, kandi gupfa ni vyo vyiza kurusha. <verse eid="PHP 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 1:22" />Mbandanije kubaho mu mubiri, vyotuma nama ivyamwa vyinshi kubwa Kristo. Mu vy’ukuri, sinzi ico nohitamwo! <verse eid="PHP 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 1:23" />Numva vyose binkwega: gupfa nkigira kubana na Kristo, ni vyo birushirije kuba vyiza kuri jewe, <verse eid="PHP 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHP 1:24" />ariko ku bwanyu, iciza ni uko nobandanya kubaho mu mubiri. <verse eid="PHP 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHP 1:25" />Kandi kubera ivyo ndazi ntakekeranya ko nzokomeza kubaho, kugira ngo nkomeze kubafasha gukura no kwumva umunezero uva mu kwizera. <verse eid="PHP 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PHP 1:26" />Ivyo bizotuma ninagaruka iwanyu, muzorushiriza kunezerwa muri Kristo Yesu kubera ibikorwa vyiza ariko arakorera muri mwebwe.<verse eid="PHP 1:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ubuzima bujanye n’Ubutumwa Bwiza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PHP 1:27" />Muri vyose, mugire ingeso zijanye n’Ubutumwa Bwiza bwa Kristo kugira ngo, ninashobora kuza tukongera tukabonana canke bidashobotse, nzokwumve ko mushikamye kandi muri umwe mu Mpwemu, mufise umutima umwe, mugwanira ukwizera kuva ku Butumwa Bwiza. <verse eid="PHP 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PHP 1:28" />Ntimuterwe ubwoba n’ababagwanya. Ico ni co kizobabera ikimenyetso ko bagiye kurandurwa, ariko ko mwebwe mugiye kuronka agakiza, na ko kakaba kava ku Mana yonyene. <verse eid="PHP 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PHP 1:29" />Kuko mutagiriwe ubuntu bwo kwizera Kristo gusa, ahubwo mwahawe n’ubwo gushobora kubabazwa ku bwiwe. <verse eid="PHP 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PHP 1:30" />Turi kumwe muri iyo ntambara. Mwarabonye ingene nayigwanye muri kahise, kandi murazi ko n’ubu nkiri muri yo.<verse eid="PHP 1:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="PHP 2" />
  <para style="s1">Ukugira kamere ka Kristo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 2:1" />Nimba hari ukuremeshwa muronkeshwa no kuba muri Kristo, nimba hari ukwirurwa kuva mu rukundo rwiwe, nimba hari ugufatanya hagati yanyu kuva muri Mpwemu, nimba hari ubugwaneza n’impuhwe hagati yanyu, <verse eid="PHP 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 2:2" />nimwuzuze umunezero wanje mu kugira umutima umwe n’urukundo rumwe, muhuje umutima n’inama mu vyiyumviro no mu ntumbero. <verse eid="PHP 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 2:3" />Ntihakagire ico mukora musunitswe n’ukwikunda canke n’ukwishira hejuru, ariko mu kwicisha bugufi, mushire abandi imbere. <verse eid="PHP 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 2:4" />Ntihagire ico mukora muronderera inyungu zanyu gusa, ariko mwiyumvire no ku nyungu z’abandi.<verse eid="PHP 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 2:5" />Mu migenderanire yanyu, mugire inyifato nk’iyo Kristo Yesu yari afise:<verse eid="PHP 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 2:6" />We, naho yari Imana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:6">ntiyigeze abona ko kungana n’Imana ari ikintu co kwumirako.<verse eid="PHP 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 2:7" />Ahubwo, yiyambuye ubumana bwiwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:7">yambara ishusho y’umugurano,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:7">acika uwusa n’abantu.<verse eid="PHP 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 2:8" />Kandi amaze kuboneka mw’ishusho y’umuntu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:8">yicisha bugufi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:8">aragamburuka gushika no ku rupfu,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PHP 2:8">mbere urupfu rwo ku musaraba.<verse eid="PHP 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 2:9" />Ni co catumye Imana imushira hejuru cane,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:9">imuha izina rirengeye ayandi mazina yose<verse eid="PHP 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 2:10" />kugira ngo mw’izina rya Yesu, amavi yose aze apfukame,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:10">ari ay’ivyo mw’ijuru, ay’ivyo kw’isi n’ay’ivy’i kuzimu,<verse eid="PHP 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 2:11" />kandi indimi zose zize zature ko Yesu Kristo ari Umwami,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:11">kugira ngo biheshe Imana Data icubahiro.<verse eid="PHP 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mube umuco w’isi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 2:12" />Bakunzi banje, nk’uko mwamye mugamburuka igihe cose nari kumwe namwe, n’ubu ntari kumwe namwe, mukwiye kurushirizaho. Mukorane umwete ibikorwa bigaragaza agakiza kanyu, mwubaha Imana, muhinda agashitsi imbere yayo, <verse eid="PHP 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 2:13" />kuko Imana ari yo ikorera muri mwebwe, ikabaha ugushaka no gukora ivyo igomba.<verse eid="PHP 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 2:14" />Mukore vyose mutidodomba kandi mudaharira, <verse eid="PHP 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 2:15" />kugira ngo mubeho mutagira umugayo, mugororotse, mube abana b’Imana batagira agatosi mu bantu b’iki gihe bagoramye kandi bononekaye, abo mubonekamwo mwakaka nk’inyenyeri zo kw’ijuru. <verse eid="PHP 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 2:16" />Mugumye cane ijambo ritanga ubugingo, ni ho nzoronka ico nirata ku musi w’ukugaruka kwa Kristo, kuko ntazoba nirukiye ubusa, kandi igikorwa canje ntikizoba cabaye impfagusa. <verse eid="PHP 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 2:17" />Mbere n’aho ndi hafi gutanga ubuzima bwanje ngo busukwe nk’uko ibinyobwa bisukwa kw’ishikanwa, iryo naryo akaba ari ibikorwa vyanyu biva mu kwizera, ndabinezererewe kandi nezeranywe namwe mwese. <verse eid="PHP 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 2:18" />Ni vyo bikwiye, na mwebwe nyene mukwiye kunezeranwa nanje.<verse eid="PHP 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ivya Timoteyo na Epafurodite</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 2:19" />Umwami Yesu niyabikunda, nzobarungikira Timoteyo, kugira ngo nanje nzoterwe intege igihe nzokwumva amakuru yanyu. <verse eid="PHP 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 2:20" />Nta wundi n’umwe mfise abitwararitse vy’ukuri nka we. <verse eid="PHP 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 2:21" />Abandi bose bitayeho ivyabo, nta witayeho ivya Yesu Kristo. <verse eid="PHP 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 2:22" />Ariko murazi ko Timoteyo yerekanye ubwizigirwa bwiwe, kuko yakoranye nanje mu kuvuga Ubutumwa Bwiza, nk’uko umwana akorana n’umuvyeyi. <verse eid="PHP 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 2:23" />Nizigiye kuzoca ndamubarungikira maze kubona uko ivyanje bizoba bigiye kumera. <verse eid="PHP 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHP 2:24" />Kandi nanje nizeye ko Umwami azonshoboza kubagendera vuba.<verse eid="PHP 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHP 2:25" />Ariko, nabonye ko ari vyiza kurungika Epafurodite akagaruka iwanyu. Ni mwene Data vy’ukuri akorana nanje kandi agwanana nanje intambara. Mwamundungikiye nk’intumwa kugira ngo amfashe mu vyo nari nkeneye. <verse eid="PHP 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PHP 2:26" />Ndamurungitse kuko abakumbuye cane kandi ahagaritswe umutima n’uko mwumvise ko yagwaye. <verse eid="PHP 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="PHP 2:27" />Ni vyo yaragwaye ahakwa no gupfa, ariko Imana yamugiriye ubuntu nk’ubwo yangiriye, kugira ngo sinicwe no kugira umubabaro ukuranwa n’uwundi. <verse eid="PHP 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PHP 2:28" />Ni co gituma nezerewe cane no kumubarungikira, kugira ngo nimwamubona muze munezerwe, nanje nsubize umutima mu nda ku bwanyu. <verse eid="PHP 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PHP 2:29" />Mumwakire mu Mwami n’umunezero mwinshi, mumuhe icubahiro kibereye abantu nka we, <verse eid="PHP 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PHP 2:30" />kuko yahatswe gupfa azira igikorwa ca Kristo akongera agahakwa gupfa ariko ankorera ibikorwa mutari gushobora kunkorera muri hiyo.<verse eid="PHP 2:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="PHP 3" />
  <para style="s1">Kristo ni we twirata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 3:1" />Bene Data, munezerwe mu Mwami mu vyo mucamwo vyose! Ibi ntibindambira gusubira kubibandikira, kuko ari kugira ngo bizigame ukwizera kwanyu. <verse eid="PHP 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 3:2" />Mwirinde za mbwa, mwirinde za nkozi z’ibibi, bamwe bikebagura bakababwira ko mutegerezwa gukebwa kugira ngo mukizwe. <verse eid="PHP 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 3:3" />Kuko, twebwe dusengera Imana muri Mpwemu, tukirata Kristo Yesu, kandi ntitwishimire ivy’uwu mubiri, ni twebwe twakebwe ugukebwa kw’ukuri. <verse eid="PHP 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 3:4" />Ariko, jewe noronka ivyo nishimira bivuye mu nkomezi zanje, kurusha uwari we wese. Mu vy’ukuri nimba hariho abandi bafise ibituma bishimira ibivuye mu nkomezi zabo, jewe ndabarusha.<verse eid="PHP 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 3:5" />Nakebwe ku musi ugira umunani, ndi Umwisirayeli ku bw’amaraso, ngakomoka mu muryango wa Benyamini, ndi Umuheburayo w’ukuri; ku vyerekeye ivyagezwe, ndi Umufarisayo; <verse eid="PHP 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 3:6" />ku vyerekeye ishaka, nahama ishengero, kandi ku vyerekeye ukugororoka kuzanwa n’ivyagezwe, nta mugayo wambonekako.<verse eid="PHP 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 3:7" />Ariko ivyo n’aho nahora nibaza ko bifise agaciro, ubu ndavyiyumvira nk’ibitagira ikimazi, kubera ivyo Kristo yakoze. <verse eid="PHP 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 3:8" />Ikirengeye ivyo vyose, n’uko ubu ibintu vyose ndavyiyumvira nk’ibitagira ikimazi kubera namenye ikibirengeye ari co Kristo Yesu, Umwami wanje. Ku bw’uwo, nahevye ibindi vyose, ndabihindura ubusa kugira ngo ndonke Kristo, <verse eid="PHP 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 3:9" />kandi mboneke ndi muri we, ntafise ukugororoka kwanje kuzanwa no kwubahiriza ivyagezwe, ariko mfise ukugororoka kuzanwa n’ukwizera Kristo. Kuko inzira y’Imana mu kuduhindura abagororotsi imbere yayo ica ku kwizera. <verse eid="PHP 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 3:10" />Nipfuza kumenya Kristo no kumenya burya bushobozi bwamuzuye mu bapfuye no gusangira na we imibabaro yiwe, nse na we no mu rupfu rwiwe, <verse eid="PHP 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 3:11" />kugira ngo nanje nzobe mw’izuka ry’abapfuye.<verse eid="PHP 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 3:12" />Singomba kuvuga ko ivyo maze kubishikira, canke ko maze gutunganywa rwose. Ariko, ndabandanya kugira ngo nshikire ukwo gutunganywa kwatumye Kristo Yesu amfata. <verse eid="PHP 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 3:13" />Bene Data, siniyumvira ko maze gufata ico ndondera. Ariko, ico nkora ni iki kimwe: Nibagira ivyarenganye, ngakurikira ibiri imbere. <verse eid="PHP 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 3:14" />Ndabandanya kugira ngo nshike ku mpera y’umuhamagaro, hanyuma ndonke impera yo mw’ijuru, iyo Imana yaduhamagariye muri Kristo Yesu.<verse eid="PHP 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Gufatira akarorero kuri Pawulo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 3:15" />Abakuze mu kwizera twese twiyumvire dutyo. Nihagira ico tutumva co kimwe, Imana izokibatahuza. <verse eid="PHP 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 3:16" />Ariko ivyo tumaze gutahura tubigenderemwo.<verse eid="PHP 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 3:17" />Bene Data, mumfatireko akarorero, kandi mwigire kuri abo bose bakurikiza akarorero kacu. <verse eid="PHP 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 3:18" />Nari maze kubibabwira kenshi, kandi n’ubu ndongeye ndabibasubiriyemwo n’amarira menshi, ko hari benshi bigenza nk’abansi b’umusaraba wa Kristo. <verse eid="PHP 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 3:19" />Iherezo ryabo ni ukurandurwa. Imana yabo ni inda yabo, kandi ivyobateye isoni ni vyo bihimbaro vyabo. Nta kindi biyumvira atari ivy’iyi si gusa. <verse eid="PHP 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 3:20" />Ariko twebwe iwacu ni mw’ijuru, ni ho twiteze ko Umukiza azozanana, ni Umwami Yesu Kristo. <verse eid="PHP 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 3:21" />Azofata uwu mubiri wacu w’intege nke kandi upfa, akawuhindure umubiri w’ubwiza usa n’uwiwe, muri bwa bushobozi afise bumushoboza gushira vyose musi y’inganji yiwe.<verse eid="PHP 3:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="PHP 4" />
  <para style="s1">Gukorana mu bumwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 4:1" />None rero, bene Data, abo nkunda kandi nipfuza cane kubona, mwebwe munezero wanje n’igitsibo canje, muhagarare mushikamye mu Mwami Yesu, bakunzi banje.<verse eid="PHP 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 4:2" />Ndinginze Ewodiya na Sintike ngo basubize hamwe mu Mwami. <verse eid="PHP 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 4:3" />Kandi ndakwinginze nawe dufatanije mu gikorwa, ngo ufashe abo bagore, kuko babanye nanje cane mu gikorwa co kubwira abandi Ubutumwa Bwiza, co kimwe na Kelementi n’abandi twakoranye, abo amazina yabo yanditswe mu gitabu c’ubugingo.<verse eid="PHP 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Amahoro y’Imana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 4:4" />Mwame munezerewe mu mwami, ndabisubiyemwo ubugira kabiri: nimunezerwe. <verse eid="PHP 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 4:5" />Ubugwaneza bwanyu bumenywe n’abantu bose, kuko Umwami wacu ari hafi. <verse eid="PHP 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 4:6" />Ntimukiganyire ku kintu na kimwe, ariko ivyo mukeneye vyose mubimenyeshe Imana mu gusenga no mu kwinginga, bifatanije no gukenguruka. <verse eid="PHP 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 4:7" />Maze amahoro y’Imana arengeye ugutahura kw’abantu azoca aza, azigamire imitima yanyu n’ubwenge bwanyu muri Kristo Yesu.<verse eid="PHP 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 4:8" />Ibisigaye bene Data, mushire ivyiyumviro vyanyu ku vy’ukuri vyose, ivy’ukwubahwa vyose, ivy’ukugororoka vyose, ibitunganye vyose, ivy’igikundiro vyose, ibishimwa vyose. Ivyo abe ari vyo mwiyumvira. <verse eid="PHP 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 4:9" />Ivyo mwigishijwe canke mwanyumvanye, canke ivyo mwambonyeko, mubishire mu ngiro. Imana y’amahoro izobana namwe.<verse eid="PHP 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pawulo ashima ivyo bamurungikiye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 4:10" />Ndanezerewe cane mu Mwami kuko mwasubiriye kunyitaho. Ndazi ko mwamye munyitaho kuva kera ariko ntimwari bwaronke akaryo ko kubingaragariza. <verse eid="PHP 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 4:11" />Ibi sindabivugishijwe n’ubukene, kuko muri vyose namenyereye kubumbwa n’ivyo mfise. <verse eid="PHP 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 4:12" />Ndazi ico ari co kuba mu bukene, kandi ndazi kubaho mu musesekara. Narize ibanga ryo kubaho muri vyose, haba mu gahimbo canke mu nzara, haba mu musesekara canke mu bukene. <verse eid="PHP 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 4:13" />Nshobozwa vyose na Kristo ampa inkomezi.<verse eid="PHP 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 4:14" />Mwagize neza kwifatanya nanje mu mibabaro ndimwo. <verse eid="PHP 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 4:15" />Kandi nk’uko mubizi mwese ab’i Filipi, mu misi ya mbere igihe Ubutumwa Bwiza bwabashikira, igihe nagomba kuja i Makedoniya, ata rindi shengero na rimwe ryamfashishije ivyo nari nkeneye, atari mwebwe, <verse eid="PHP 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 4:16" />kuko n’igihe nari i Tesalonike, mwagumye mundungikira ivyo nari nkeneye. <verse eid="PHP 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 4:17" />Ibi sindabivugishijwe no gushaka ibindi, ariko nipfuje kubashimira ku neza mwangiriye. <verse eid="PHP 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 4:18" />Ubu mfise ivyo nkeneye vyose, ndetse n’umusesekara, kuko naronse ingabire nyinshi mwarungikanye Epafurodite. Zimeze nk’amavuta amota neza, ikimazi cemerwa, gihimbara Imana. <verse eid="PHP 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 4:19" />Imana izobaha ivyo mukeneye vyose nk’uko ubutunzi bw’ubwiza bwayo butangaje buri muri Kristo Yesu.<verse eid="PHP 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 4:20" />Icubahiro kibe ic’Imana Data wa twese ibihe vyose, Amen.<verse eid="PHP 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s1">Intasho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 4:21" />Mundamukirize abera bose muri Kristo Yesu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="PHP 4:21">Bene Data turi kumwe barabatasha.<verse eid="PHP 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 4:22" />Abera bose barabatasha, na canecane abo mu nzu kwa Kayisari.<verse eid="PHP 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 4:23" />Ubuntu bw’Umwami wacu Yesu Kristo bubane n’impwemu yanyu. Amen.<verse eid="PHP 4:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 4" />
</usx>